ration and swelling of hepatic cells as well as hyperplasia of bile ducts; HE &#x000d7; 200.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MI2009-602935.002"/></fig><fig id="fig3" position="float"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>Model-control group 28 days; hyperplasia of small hepatic bile ducts and obvious degeneration of hepatic cells; HE &#x000d7; 200.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MI2009-602935.003"/></fig><fig id="fig4" position="float"><label>Figure 4</label><caption><p>Sham-operated group 28 days; granular substances were seen in the space between glomerular capillaries as well as in the glomerulus and the cytoplasm of renal tubular epithelial cells, and patchy necrosis of renal tubular epithelium was also observed; HE &#x000d7; 200.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MI2009-602935.004"/></fig><fig id="fig5" position="float"><label>Figure 5</label><caption><p>Treated group 21 days; obvious glomerular congestion and renal tubular degeneration; HE &#x000d7; 200.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MI2009-602935.005"/></fig><fig id="fig6" position="float"><label>Figure 6</label><caption><p>Treated group 28 days; turbidity and degeneration of renal tubular epithelial cells as well as vascular congestion; HE &#x000d7; 200.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MI2009-602935.006"/></fig><fig id="fig7" position="float"><label>Figure 7</label><caption><p>Sham-operated group 28 days; normal lung tissue; HE &#x000d7; 200.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MI2009-602935.007"/></fig><fig id="fig8" position="float"><label>Figure 8</label><caption><p>Treated group 28 days; capillary distension and congestion in the alveolar wall as well as inflammatory cell infiltration in the alveolar septum; HE &#x000d7; 400.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MI2009-602935.008"/></fig><fig id="fig9" position="float"><label>Figure 9</label><caption><p>Sham-operated group 28 days; hyperplasia of cells in the splenic sinus, enlargement of blood sinus, inflammatory cell infiltration, and hemorrhage; HE &#x000d7; 200.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MI2009-602935.009"/></fig><fig id="fig10" position="float"><label>Figure 10</label><caption><p>Sham-operated group 28 days; enlargement of splenic sinusoid and hyperplasia of fibrous tissue; HE &#x000d7; 200.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MI2009-602935.010"/></fig><fig id="fig11" position="float"><label>Figure 11</label><caption><p>Treated group 28 days; enlargement and congestion of splenic sinusoid; HE &#x000d7; 200.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MI2009-602935.011"/></fig><fig id="fig12" position="float"><label>Figure 12</label><caption><p>Sham-operated group 28 days; hyperplasia of sinus cell and inflammatory cell infiltration in lymph node; HE &#x000d7; 200.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MI2009-602935.012"/></fig><fig id="fig13" position="float"><label>Figure 13</label><caption><p>Treated group 28 days; normal lymph node; HE &#x000d7; 100.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="MI2009-602935.013"/></fig><table-wrap id="tab1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Comparison of endotoxin, PLA<sub>2</sub>, and TNF-<italic>&#x003b1;</italic> level.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="2" colspan="1">Indexes</th><th align="center" colspan="2" rowspan="1">Sham-operated group</th><th align="center" colspan="2" rowspan="1">Model-control group</th><th align="center" colspan="2" rowspan="1">Treated group</th></tr><tr><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">21 d</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">28 d</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">21 d</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">28 d</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">21 d</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">28 d</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Endotoxin (Eu/mL)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.2 &#x000b1; 0.05</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.3 &#x000b1; 0.04</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.7 &#x000b1; 0.1**</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.8 &#x000b1; 0.1**</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.5 &#x000b1; 0.1** ++ </td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.5 &#x000b1; 0.1** ++ </td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">PLA<sub>2</sub> (U/mL)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">207.2 &#x000b1; 38.6</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">203.0 &#x000b1; 31.0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">701.0 &#x000b1; 151.7**</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">738.6 &#x000b1; 60.2**</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">593.2 &#x000b1; 146.3**</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">645.6 &#x000b1; 95.1** ++ </td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">TNF-<italic>&#x003b1;</italic> (pg/mL)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14.2 &#x000b1; 3.2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">15.6 &#x000b1; 4.9</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">31.5 &#x000b1; 11.0**</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">57.70 &#x000b1; 13.0**</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">24.4 &#x000b1; 9.2**</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">44.2 &#x000b1; 23.1**</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>Compare to sham-operated group, *<italic>P</italic> &#x0003c; .05, **<italic>P</italic> &#x0003c; .01; compare to model-control group, <sup>+</sup><italic>P</italic> &#x0003c; .05, <sup>++</sup><italic>P</italic> &#x0003c; .01.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>